SUMMARY:The Gnostics
DESCRIPTION:Rosicrucians AMORC\, Santa Rosa\, CA\nGnosticism and gnostic a
 re broad terms and highly intriguing in their nature and associated histor
 y. We will give an overview of their meaning and their value to the Rosicr
 ucian student. They remain part of our on-going experience of the mystical
  path. Join Hugh McCague as we continue to explore Rosicrucian laws and pr
 inciples and their creative expression and application for the mastery of 
 life\, harmonious living\, and service.\n\n**Please RSVP to access log-in 
 information. Click ATTEND ONLINE below.**
