SUMMARY:Tests and Breakthroughs on the Mystical Path
DESCRIPTION:Rosicrucians AMORC\, Santa Rosa\, CA\nNo matter how developed 
 and mature we may be\, we will be continually tested as to our sincerity\,
  integrity\, and readiness to proceed on the mystical path. If we pass the
  trial\, we undergo a breakthrough\, a freeing up\, small or large in livi
 ng. The Inner Self is never fooled by the outer self and is ever present t
 o guide us aright if we are serious and have courage. Join Hugh McCague as
  we continue to explore Rosicrucian laws and principles and their creative
  expression and application for the mastery of life\, harmonious living\, 
 and service.\n\n**Please RSVP to access log-in information. Click ATTEND O
 NLINE below.**
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/amorc-santa-rosa-pronaos/events/31637
 0680/
