SUMMARY:Mystical Poetry III
DESCRIPTION:Rosicrucians AMORC\, Santa Rosa\, CA\nThe \\*[November 1972 is
 sue of the](https://b45e1c3778bbf3ebb96c-637cca54df3fd347e9c3d5d35c2f839a.
 ssl.cf5.rackcdn.com/Rosicrucian_Digest_v50_n11_1972_OCR.pdf)*[Rosicrucian 
 Digest](https://b45e1c3778bbf3ebb96c-637cca54df3fd347e9c3d5d35c2f839a.ssl.
 cf5.rackcdn.com/Rosicrucian_Digest_v50_n11_1972_OCR.pdf)*\\*included an ar
 ticle entitled “Mystic Poetry” by Peter Bowden. We will continue to fo
 llow up on that article and consider how our mystical experience though in
 effable is nevertheless eminently worth describing and sharing through var
 ious forms of creative expression. We will consider poetry in its wide-ran
 ging forms for the conveyance of mystical experience and the emulation of 
 the Cosmic. Join Hugh McCague as we continue to explore Rosicrucian laws a
 nd principles and their creative expression and application for the master
 y of life\, harmonious living\, and service.\n\n**Please RSVP to access lo
 g-in information. Click ATTEND ONLINE below.**
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/amorc-santa-rosa-pronaos/events/31637
 0769/
