SUMMARY:Music\, A Mystical Art
DESCRIPTION:Rosicrucians AMORC\, Santa Rosa\, CA\nTopic:\n**Music\, A Myst
 ical Art**\n**Atrium Group Ritual presented by Frank Nappi\, F.R.C.**\n\nA
 ll AMORC members\, their families and friends of the Rosicrucian Order are
  welcome to attend. We are delighted to have you join us in ritual and dis
 cussion.\n\n• Important to know- Doors open for members and non-member f
 riends of the Rosicrucian Order by 6:30 PM. Please arrive early! The Atriu
 m Group ritual begins promptly at 7:00 PM. AMORC Members - please bring yo
 ur Active member credentials or Active membership dues receipt.\n\nFollowi
 ng the meeting:\n1st Tuesday- Mystical Seekers Series Public Presentation 
 at 8:00 PM\n\nThe Santa Rosa Pronaos operates under the law of AMRA. You m
 ay give as your heart and mind direct you.\n\nThe Santa Rosa Pronaos is a 
 501c3 educational non-profit\, an affiliated body of the Rosicrucian Engli
 sh Grand Lodge for the Americas and the Caribbean.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/amorc-santa-rosa-pronaos/events/31545
 8666/
